    "notes": "One vessel, two contributors on one slot: part 2 (LiquidFuel/Oxidizer) gets its meter from the built-in `core` contribution, part 3 (Water/Food) gets its meter from the planted Uplink (scripts/probe/plantedUplink.ts), which meters every stored resource the built-in five leave alone. Demonstrates spec §13.4's self-contribution unify: one aggregated slot, two contributors, rendered by the SAME code path. Food.amount is deliberately small (0.4) to catch a fmtAmt-style rounding-to-zero bug in the tooltip's Meter valueLabel."
